@base = http://localhost:5120
@alice = FR7630006000011234567890189
@bob = FR1230006000019876543210452

### The accounts before the import: Alice 1,000 €, Bob 500 €
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}

###
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{bob}}

### "Dry run" import: the same filters, without the last one (Execute). Nothing is modified; the report tells what would go through.
POST {{base}}/imports?dryRun=true
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./Transfers-sample.csv

### The import: 11 lines, 3 transfers executed, 8 rejections, each one by the filter concerned (firstRejections)
### The report also measures each stage: items processed, processing time, waiting for the next pipe
POST {{base}}/imports
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./Transfers-sample.csv

### Alice: 842.80 €; Bob: 657.20 €
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}

### Replay the same file: nothing is executed twice ("already executed" duplicates); only VIR-009 goes through, Bob now having enough to pay
POST {{base}}/imports
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./Transfers-sample.csv

### The imports done, and the report of one of them
GET {{base}}/imports

###
GET {{base}}/imports/1

### A failure in the middle of an import (an exception, not a rejection): the whole pipeline stops, 500.
### Run on a freshly started API, then run the normal import again: it finishes the job without redoing anything.
POST {{base}}/imports?failureAtReference=VIR-010
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./Transfers-sample.csv

### ─── Throughput, bottleneck, back-pressure ───

### 100,000 lines generated on the fly, 1 copy of the fraud check: it is the bottleneck (occupancy ≈ 0.94),
### the other stages spend their time waiting (outputWaitMs); maxInFlight stays at a few hundred
POST {{base}}/demo/bulk-import
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lines": 100000, "fraudParallelism": 1 }

### 8 copies of the fraud check: several times faster, same result
POST {{base}}/demo/bulk-import
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lines": 100000, "fraudParallelism": 8 }

### A light fraud score: parallelizing moves the bottleneck to another stage (Validate)
POST {{base}}/demo/bulk-import
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lines": 100000, "fraudParallelism": 8, "scoringCost": 5 }
